  description: Barely got away from them. Not the dead, but other survivors. They
    kept me locked up in the basement of the old school, took almost everything.
    Their boss laughed when I asked about you. He said he saw a woman matching your
    description, but she's been dead for days. He was lying. I know he was lying.
    I need to lay low in these alleys for a bit and rest.
